:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Blanka (Enemy)]].''
'''Blanka''' is a [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 8.10 Update#Update 8.10.5|Version 8.10.5]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 515
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Blanka
|name2 = Blanka CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Blanka CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Blanka is an incredibly powerful kamikaze rusher that's comparable to many other units within this niche, such as [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Yukimura]] and Awakened Bahamut in that he's a fragile unit with low cooldown and cost, yet capable of dealing great damage. For non-Aliens, this number goes up to 204,000 if his full backswing cooldown is abused properly, and when against aliens this can shoot up to 816,000. His Omni Strike and Barrier Breaker only make things better, as despite his low range, he is able to hit further than other rushers, and Starred Aliens' Barriers are no match when he strikes.

{{Job|Classification = Rusher & Nuker}}

